{
  "id": "electrical_motor_calculator__power__efficiency___t",
  "title": "Electrical Motor Calculator: Power, Efficiency & Torque Calculations",
  "description": "Calculate amps, hp and kVA for electrical motors. This calculator helps determine electric motor amps, horsepower and 3-phase kVA based on input parameters.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Electrical Motor Calculator\n\nCalculate current (amps), power (horsepower), and 3-phase apparent power (kVA) for electrical motors.\n\n## Key Definitions:\n- **RLA** - Running Load Amps: current drawn during normal operation\n- **FLA** - Full Load Amps: current drawn at full-load torque and horsepower (typically RLA + 25%)\n- **Conversion**: 1 hp = 0.745 kW"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Current (Amps) Calculator",
        "Power (Horsepower) Calculator",
        "3-Phase kVA Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "voltage",
          "label": "Voltage",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 480
        },
        {
          "id": "power_hp",
          "label": "Power",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "hp",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "efficiency",
          "label": "Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 85
        },
        {
          "id": "power_factor",
          "label": "Power Factor",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "",
          "defaultValue": 0.85
        },
        {
          "id": "phase",
          "label": "Phase",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "1-Phase",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "label": "3-Phase",
              "value": 3
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 3
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "current_amps",
          "label": "Current (Amps)",
          "unit": "A",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.power_hp * 746) / (inputs.voltage * inputs.power_factor * inputs.efficiency / 100)"
        },
        {
          "id": "power_kw",
          "label": "Power",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.power_hp * 0.745"
        },
        {
          "id": "apparent_power_kva",
          "label": "Apparent Power (3-Phase kVA)",
          "unit": "kVA",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.voltage * inputs.current_amps * inputs.phase) / 1000"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}